{"id":"emocionante","lemma":"emocionante","pos":"adj","rank":1744,"glosses":["touching","exciting"],"ipa":"/emoθjoˈnante/","forms":{"femininePlural":"emocionantes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-emocionante.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto es tan emocionante.","en":"This is so exciting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448282"},{"text":"¡Qué juego tan emocionante!","en":"What an exciting game!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733951"},{"text":"Esa película es emocionante.","en":"That movie is exciting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461071"},{"text":"La ciencia es muy emocionante.","en":"Science is very exciting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639778"},{"text":"Tom encontró la experiencia emocionante.","en":"Tom found the experience exhilarating.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804344"}]}